--- text
Your one-time sign-in code

Someone asked to sign in to [PRODUCT_NAME] as [EMAIL_ADDRESS]. Enter
this 6-digit code to finish signing in.

[OTP_CODE]

This code expires at [EXPIRY_ABSOLUTE] - [EXPIRY_RELATIVE] after it
was sent.

Important: Nobody from [COMPANY_NAME] will ever ask you for this
code by phone, email or chat. If you did not try to sign in,
someone else may have your password. Change your password, and do
not enter this code anywhere.

Questions about this message? Write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real
person reads every message, and we will never ask you for your
password.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
